AltoCappedChainlinkOracle::getPrice()
├── when chainlink feed is stale
│   └── it should revert with ModuleChainlinkInvalidRate
├── when chainlink price is zero
│   └── it should revert with ModuleChainlinkInvalidRate
├── when chainlink price is within ERC4626 max allowed growth
│   └── it should return the price without capping
├── when chainlink price exceeds ERC4626 max allowed growth
│   └── it should return the capped price
├── when outDecimals is 36 and price is within cap
│   └── it should return nav scaled to 36 decimals
└── when outDecimals is 36 and cap binds
    └── it should return the capped price in 36 decimals
